Status: Individual scene draft; whole-film pass provisionally accepted, individual author review pending

INT. SECURE EVIDENCE OFFICE - TUESDAY

Ruth holds a separate sealed envelope. Zoe carries the original drive in the backpack she has guarded since the airport. An evidence officer records her signature, bags and seals the drive with restricted access and an audit trail. Earlier working copies remain separately accounted for.

The backpack is nearly empty. Zoe keeps it anyway. The handover has an identifiable recipient and limits; nothing has been published wholesale.
